  "description": "Two-way Crestron SIMPL# Pro driver for LG commercial displays over the LG serial control protocol (the \"ka\"/\"kf\"/\"ke\"/\"xb\" command set) via serial-over-IP / native LAN control. Power, volume, mute, and input select with OK/NG acknowledgement parsing, plus a raw command escape hatch. Verified against the LG 60WL30MS-D command set.",
